ntion relates to a member LYC1 of a novel lysozymes gene family. The invention provides the cDNA sequence encoding for the novel lysozyme, the polypeptide encoded by the sequence, as well as the method producing said novel human lysozyme utilising recombinant technology. The invention also provides the use of the novel human lysozyme.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un membre LYC1 d'une nouvelle famille de gène du lysozyme. L'invention concerne aussi la séquence d'ADN complémentaire codant pour le nouveau lysozyme, le polypeptide codé par la séquence et le procédé de production de ce nouveau lysozyme humain utilisant cette technologie recombinante. L'invention concerne en outre l'utilisation du nouveau lysozyme humain.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>